<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-15T17:13:34.972Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:13:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces arrested the main suspect in the 2013 Baniyas massacre and sentenced two individuals to death for the 2025 coastal sectarian violence, while another pair received death sentences for related clashes. A gas export pipeline in northeastern Syria was attacked, causing a fire, and Syrian intelligence detained a militia leader linked to the 2013 Baniyas massacre. Qatar and Syria’s interior ministries deepened security cooperation in Damascus, and Israeli Prime Minister Netanyahu disclosed direct contact with Syrian President Ahmed al-Sharaa regarding the Druze community. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBjY245VUZyaXhiU3hueFBkeWJfLU9LcXdESDFIQldES0J6QWhOODFjbHMtZFRPYUpOTmZSTWl1RFNOYU50SlZyVmVzTHdESjVpM2k4aU9saktqdHVpV2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPMTFGTjEzTHZLMHItSUtOcG5oQVNOeWttMy1uVnVJR0Z1SjJNVkxsOGVweGJWS1djLW0zQk1pcVkxSEFjZmlhQkgtZDBPUExLYWhSTkZCX0l2aVJwNTFLdkVOdjg1b3RSMzFDVV9aRDBsc0QzQWdwQVNSUzNzOXZ5MVg5U0tOQ3JzYVI0T0h6djJVaVVQa0FGalppX0U3R3ZTT3NfTHlXOUJDZmdBeHp3OEdmYlNRM3ExYm05WU11RGR5WXUzMlJoZTdQb0o?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNSUdqMExHVTF6YW96aEpfN0p0a3RjX2QyRnY3Rm42d01PR0puY1ZJWmVQZ1J5UXY4Qkd4LW5jU1RtU1hpTDg2U0ZvTU1ldm5BUzhlLU1LaG1oRkZVU0tPM3dtS1paakJYcHRmdVI0Qm1TSmViYTdvdlNiSU5YZGpyY0p3RDk4MEJTd0ppVDVFMV80ZEFvNlAtUTNLYVFiU2Q4VmVDZmk2WVQzeTNDUmRRMHBTVWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Firstpost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot